This ROS 1 package adapts Robot-Nav/PP_Controller.
Upstream source and license: https://github.com/Robot-Nav/PP_Controller

The standalone C++ control law was adapted to this package's path, pose and
velocity types. The ROS 1 node integrates Path, Odometry and Twist messages,
and applies a minimum-turning-radius limit. The packaging, launch setup and
license labeling were updated for this distribution on 2026-11-22.

